WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.150
Confirm the school. Check the school name before a family uses the lobby device. The kiosk must be approved for this school.

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:26.300
Choose Family and PIN or QR. A verified guardian uses their private credential. Never expose real PINs or QR codes in a tutorial.

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:39.450
Verify before selecting children. In normal use, confirm the returned family and select only the children arriving or leaving. Follow protected pickup warnings.

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:52.600
Wait for confirmation. After an authorized check-in or check-out, wait for completion and reset the screen. Do not repeat an uncertain action.

